* T-07 / T-28 / T-24: the pin with the driver tristated.
* Control levels are fractions of VDDIO (Voef/Vdinf/Vpunf/Vpdf) so one request
* tracks every supply corner. Default state: output disabled, DIN low, weak
* pull-up off (PUN high), weak pull-down off (PD low).
* The pin is forced by Bpin through the zero-volt series source Vacp, whose
* current is the pin current (positive = into the forcing side from the pad)
* and which carries the AC stimulus for the capacitance steps.
Voef oef 0 dc 0
Vdinf dinf 0 dc 0
Vpunf punf 0 dc 1
Vpdf pdf 0 dc 0
Boe oe_p 0 V=v(oef)*v(vddio)
Bdin din_p 0 V=v(dinf)*v(vddio)
Bpun pun_p 0 V=v(punf)*v(vddio)
Bpd pd_p 0 V=v(pdf)*v(vddio)
Vpf pf 0 dc 0
Bpin pb 0 V=v(pf)*v(vddio)
Vacp pad_p pb dc 0 ac 0
Xesd_p pad_p padi_p vddio 0 aib_pad_esd
Xtx_p din_p oe_p pun_p pd_p pad_p vddio 0 aib_tx_data
Xrx_p padi_p dout_p vddio 0 aib_rx_data
